    {
      "displayText": "Hi there! I’m a specialist in restoring Pokémon\nfossils.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800690020007400680065007200650021002000492019006D002000610020007300700065006300690061006C00690073007400200069006E00200072006500730074006F00720069006E006700200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E000A0066006F007300730069006C0073002E00100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Did you know that the <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Stone Emporium<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000> here in\nLumiose has two varieties of fossil for sale?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "They’re the Jaw Fossil and the Sail Fossil.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’ve had my eye on them for a while now, but I\njust can’t decide which one to get!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 134
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Would you mind picking one out for me to break\nthe deadlock? Choose whichever you like!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You received <U+E300>20,000 from Reg!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 1,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020007200650063006500690076006500640020E30000320030002C003000300030002000660072006F006D002000520065006700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Once you’ve bought either a <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Jaw Fossil <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>or a <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Sail<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>\n<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>Fossil<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>, please bring it back here.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJust so you know, the Stone Emporium is over on\nVernal Avenue!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 22,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
