      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Welcome back! Did you buy one of the fossils I\nasked for?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570065006C0063006F006D00650020006200610063006B0021002000440069006400200079006F007500200062007500790020006F006E00650020006F0066002000740068006500200066006F007300730069006C007300200049000A00610073006B0065006400200066006F0072003F00100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wha...? I gave you money. You DID buy me one of\nthe fossils I wanted, didn’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! You brought me a piece of Old Amber?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThis is great and all, but I’m looking to restore one\nof the fossils I mentioned before.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, before that, make sure you have space in your\nBoxes! You should never restore fossils otherwise.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 105
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>So you chose <U+0010><U+0003>ጂ<U+0002><U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>ĉ<U+0002>! Thanks\nso much!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD0600000053006F00200079006F0075002000630068006F00730065002000100003130200020000001000020109000200210020005400680061006E006B0073000A0073006F0020006D007500630068002100100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll restore it right away—wait here just a second.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C00200072006500730074006F007200650020006900740020007200690067006800740020006100770061007920140077006100690074002000680065007200650020006A007500730074002000610020007300650063006F006E0064002E00100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voilà! The Pokémon restored from the Jaw Fossil\nis...Tyrunt!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0069006C00E00021002000540068006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200072006500730074006F007200650064002000660072006F006D00200074006800650020004A0061007700200046006F007300730069006C000A00690073002E002E002E0054007900720075006E0074002100100002011401410000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Voilà! The Pokémon restored from the Sail Fossil\nis...Amaura!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2896,
