      "offsetInSection": 3044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006D00610061006100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On reflection, I think you should be the one to\nraise this <U+0010><U+0002>ā<U+0003>.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nYou were very kind to carry out my odd request—\nthat makes you a trustworthy Trainer in my book!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŁ",
